  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> method acting or lesser spirit power class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> For each spirit you can channel and each persona you can assume, select a casting tradition. These casting traditions must all grant you the same number of bonus spell points, and you gain bonus spell points from only a single casting tradition.<br>\nWhile you are channeling a spirit or in a persona, you use the chosen casting tradition in place of your normal casting tradition for the purpose of determining drawbacks and boons. You retain sphere-specific drawbacks and any talents gained from them between all traditions. If you take any feats or talents that require a specific drawback, you only gain the benefits of these feats or talents while that drawback is part of your current persona or spirit’s tradition</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
